namespace = var.namespace
name = var.service_account_name
annotations = {
"azure.workload.identity/client-id" = var.service_account_
client_id
}
}
}
Using Terraform allows us to substitute dynamic values that are created during the earlier stage of
the provisioning process. Kubernetes has its own way of doing things but it involves using Helm and
has additional implementation overhead.
